    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Ocean Explorer?</h2>It's a game where you adventure around the world by ship, playing with a map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/0f7abea23c4646bbf0cf08e247756900.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story of Ocean Explorer</h2>In the not-so-distant future, human society, made convenient by the development of AI, began to entrust many matters to AI.<br>Knowledge, technology, and eventually even the act of thinking were left to AI... until one day, AI suddenly stopped its activities and disappeared.<br>Humanity, having relied heavily on AI, forgot much of its knowledge and technology.<br>The remnants of humanity continued to live on, gathering whatever usable items were left.<br><br>In the declined world of 2434, players set out to sea in a boat inherited from their parents.<br>A journey to reclaim the lost information of the world begins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/26bfd59b6a46bda46b1d29c72ed077a7.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play Ocean Explorer</h2>You become a sailor and adventure around the world.<br>Adventuring requires funds for buying bigger ships, food and water for voyages, and money to discover ruins and animals.<br>Funds can be increased by trading or completing guild requests.<br>Increase your funds for adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/25293668821e209ad8d30e0042a38c1f.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><br><br> - Discover ports around the world to create a map<br> - Defeat monsters scattered around the world<br> - Make a fortune through trade and become wealthy<br> - Discover ruins and animals to obtain rare information<br> - Find the polar regions of the world, like Antarctica and deserted islands<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/ca1fa81b381dd3b46e801ee7b014c35b.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><br><br>Gamepad Controls:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/ae17c8497b21af2b706f0106668f5820.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><br><br>Keyboard &amp; Mouse Controls:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/91e64a569003410ef7e0428dad0c3ef6.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Ocean Explorer?</h2>It's a game where you adventure around the world by ship, playing with a map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/0f7abea23c4646bbf0cf08e247756900.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story of Ocean Explorer</h2>In the not-so-distant future, human society, made convenient by the development of AI, began to entrust many matters to AI.<br>Knowledge, technology, and eventually even the act of thinking were left to AI... until one day, AI suddenly stopped its activities and disappeared.<br>Humanity, having relied heavily on AI, forgot much of its knowledge and technology.<br>The remnants of humanity continued to live on, gathering whatever usable items were left.<br><br>In the declined world of 2434, players set out to sea in a boat inherited from their parents.<br>A journey to reclaim the lost information of the world begins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/26bfd59b6a46bda46b1d29c72ed077a7.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play Ocean Explorer</h2>You become a sailor and adventure around the world.<br>Adventuring requires funds for buying bigger ships, food and water for voyages, and money to discover ruins and animals.<br>Funds can be increased by trading or completing guild requests.<br>Increase your funds for adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/25293668821e209ad8d30e0042a38c1f.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><br><br> - Discover ports around the world to create a map<br> - Defeat monsters scattered around the world<br> - Make a fortune through trade and become wealthy<br> - Discover ruins and animals to obtain rare information<br> - Find the polar regions of the world, like Antarctica and deserted islands<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/ca1fa81b381dd3b46e801ee7b014c35b.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><br><br>Gamepad Controls:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/ae17c8497b21af2b706f0106668f5820.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span><br><br>Keyboard &amp; Mouse Controls:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371450/extras/91e64a569003410ef7e0428dad0c3ef6.avif?t=1733129060\" /></span>",
